% (~/github/paperkit/cotype/README.md); the record is ours.
%
% ⚑ FILE WITH `bibstruct --add`, NEVER BY HAND — one hook-compliant call, no heredoc:
%     python3 scratch/bibstruct.py --add <key> section=finding \
%       claim="..." check=item:<key> note="kind=... by=... " \
%       --bib .claude/agents/agda-oracle.bib --apply
%
% ⚑⚑ EVERY `check` MUST NAME A REGISTERED WITNESS in .claude/agents/findings.py. A key here
